'''Komala''' (Japanese: '''ネッコアラ''' ''Nekkoara'') is a {{ct|Colorless}} Basic Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Celestial Guardians}} expansion.

