==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Guardians Rising|Komala|114}} from the {{TCG|Guardians Rising}} expansion.
** Both cards feature the {{a|Comatose}} [[Ability]], which is {{p|Komala}}'s [[signature ability]] in the [[Pokémon games]].
*'''Rolling Tackle''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Team Rocket|Dark Electrode|34}} from the {{TCG|Team Rocket}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

